correct action is: implement the file literally as specified, run the gate, and
mark STATUS=BLOCKED on compile failure. The conflict must be raised to the
prompt author so they can either (a) include a Value-rename in this prompt's
allowed-files list, or (b) widen the file restriction to permit renaming the
existing struct.

